{"3328100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bowlatro", "steam_appid": 3328100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bowlatro</i>, is a rogue-lite bowling game where every game is different from the last one. Unlock items that change how you knock over pins, experiment with pins that do unique stuff when they're knocked over, and choose from a variety of special balls to make each game different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relics: Powerful Stuff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game of <i>Bowlatro</i> begins with a relic selection, letting you choose a relic that you can build your run off of. Relics are essentially items but way stronger. Discover new relics as you progress and experiment with different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples of Relics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Pin:</strong> Transforms a normal pin into an explosive one that sends nearby pins flying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Striker:</strong> Boosts your score by 50% for each strike, but pins hit on your second shot no longer count.<strong> BUY THIS!!!!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroller:</strong> Rerolls the number of active pins each frame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bumpers:</strong> Add bouncy bumpers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/035e04a6ee3c14c341ae1c91c8442e43.poster.avif?t=1786772186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/035e04a6ee3c14c341ae1c91c8442e43.webm?t=1786772186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/035e04a6ee3c14c341ae1c91c8442e43.mp4?t=1786772186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are good.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Shop: Buy lots of stuff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every three frames, the item shop opens, offering a range of items that will help you progress through the run. Items range from unique pins with special effects to modifiers that amplify your score. Items can synergize together or really not synergize together. So, buy stuff that works in order to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples of Items:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baby Pin Launcher:</strong> Adds a pin that, when hit, launches two smaller pins in different directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grapple Pin:</strong> Hooks onto the farthest pin in the lane and pulls it closer, perfect for those banana split scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/93ae66fc0c4a51fc7d8fbfb834680886.poster.avif?t=1786772186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/93ae66fc0c4a51fc7d8fbfb834680886.webm?t=1786772186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/93ae66fc0c4a51fc7d8fbfb834680886.mp4?t=1786772186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Multiplier Reroll:</strong> Multiplies your score based on the number of rerolls you’ve used. (Only appears if you have the rerolling relic, obviously)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALLS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you can unlock new balls. They do stuff, see below for one example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/ad34dd79f91448baeb08d40fc82b7cb4.poster.avif?t=1786772186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/ad34dd79f91448baeb08d40fc82b7cb4.webm?t=1786772186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/ad34dd79f91448baeb08d40fc82b7cb4.mp4?t=1786772186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cool right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resetters: Put the ball back to the starting point</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens after you shoot the ball, before you can shoot your next shot? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball needs to be put back at the shooting point. You see I could teleport the ball back to that point but that's boring. So, instead I will move the ball back to the start, now that's exciting. But how I hear you asking? Well you see, ball resetters, that's how.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We got boats, buckets, magnets, you name it</strong>*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/493b26f8671557266e3b0eb0d5c0519c.avif?t=1786772186\" width=625 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/948c6cab2f5a53fe8292cfdf9ea9614e.avif?t=1786772186\" width=318 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328100/extras/4da37ca1195952625b7d8c6feae8a355.avif?t=1786772186\" width=196 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*</strong>Do not actually name it I only put in a handful of resetters at the moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascension Modifiers: You know where I got this idea from</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning a game in <i>Bowlatro</i> is just the beginning. Each victory unlocks a new <strong>Ascension Modifier</strong>. These modifiers alter the core mechanics, giving you more challenging scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples of Ascension Modifiers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pins Farther Apart:</strong> Pins spawn farther away from each other, making it harder to knock them all down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reduced Earnings:</strong> Earn less money per game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Pins:</strong> Pins become harder to knock down.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy the game: Or don't. I'm surprised you read this far.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bowlatro</i>, is a rogue-lite bowling game where every game is different from the last one. Unlock items that change how you knock over pins, experiment with pins that do unique stuff when they're knocked over, and choose from a variety of special balls to make each game different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relics: Powerful Stuff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game of <i>Bowlatro</i> begins with a relic selection, letting you choose a relic that you can build your run off of. Relics are essentially items but way stronger. Discover new relics as you progress and experiment with different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples of Relics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Pin:</strong> Transforms a normal pin into an explosive one that sends nearby pins flying.</p></li><li>